  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> FFMI = lean mass (kg) &divide; height (m)&sup2;. For men, <strong>17&ndash;20 is average</strong>, 20&ndash;22 trained and 22&ndash;25 very muscular; about <strong>25 is the natural limit</strong>. For women, 14.5&ndash;17 is average.</p></div>

